+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+The Worker deployment owner must bind each registered `AIChatAgent` Durable Object class, add it to a SQLite Durable Object migration using `new_sqlite_classes`, supply the model provider binding or credentials consumed by `streamText`, and deploy the Worker configuration and code together. This repository does not establish binding names, provider provisioning, migration history, or deployment state; verify those in the target Cloudflare environment.
